        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Latest flow (v3.1)&lt;/b&gt;&#10;• ONE Apigee→API call per login: /session/bootstrap&#10;• tenant from BigQuery tenant_registry — fail closed&#10;• GKE calls Looker ONLY via the reverse proxy (Apigee never touches Looker)&#10;• bootstrap returns: tiles + Home SSO URL + navigation base&#10;• after bootstrap: iframe navigations — folder ACL + RLS enforce&#10;• no edge WAF: SpikeArrest is the only brute-force control" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFF7E8;strokeColor=#9A5B00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
